{"title": "Warden of Vitality", "pageid": 10342, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Warden_of_Vitality", "categories": ["Spells", "Level 3 Spells", "Evocation spells", "Actions", "Recastable spells", "Sources of healing"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Warden_of_Vitality.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a7/Warden_of_Vitality.webp/300px-Warden_of_Vitality.webp, /w/images/a/a7/Warden_of_Vitality.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a7/Warden_of_Vitality.webp/300px-Warden_of_Vitality.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a7/Warden_of_Vitality.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Warden of Vitality </b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">level 3 evocation spell</a>. It allows spellcasters to heal allies repeatedly with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Restore_Vitality\" title=\"Restore Vitality\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Restore_Vitality_Icon.webp/20px-Restore_Vitality_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Restore_Vitality_Icon.webp/30px-Restore_Vitality_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Restore_Vitality_Icon.webp/40px-Restore_Vitality_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Restore Vitality\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Restore_Vitality_Icon.webp/20px-Restore_Vitality_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9f/Restore_Vitality_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Restore_Vitality\" title=\"Restore Vitality\">Restore Vitality</a> using only bonus actions for 10 turns.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nWhile this aura lasts, you can cast <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Restore_Vitality\" title=\"Restore Vitality\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Restore_Vitality_Icon.webp/20px-Restore_Vitality_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Restore_Vitality_Icon.webp/30px-Restore_Vitality_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Restore_Vitality_Icon.webp/40px-Restore_Vitality_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Restore Vitality\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Restore_Vitality_Icon.webp/20px-Restore_Vitality_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9f/Restore_Vitality_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Restore_Vitality\" title=\"Restore Vitality\">Restore Vitality</a> as a <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a> to heal yourself or nearby allies by <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">2d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/30px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/40px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hit Points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">Hit Points</span></a>.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a> + <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/38px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 3 Spell Slot</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: Self\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: Self</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"At_higher_levels\"> At higher levels </span></h2>\n<p>Casting this spell at a higher level grants no additional benefit. </p>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_AuraOfVitality</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_AuraOfVitality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_AuraOfVitality\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/HasVerbalComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasVerbalComponent (spell flag)\">HasVerbalComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsSpell_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsSpell (spell flag)\">IsSpell</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Grants:\"> Grants: </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Restore_Vitality\" title=\"Restore Vitality\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Restore_Vitality_Icon.webp/40px-Restore_Vitality_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Restore_Vitality_Icon.webp/60px-Restore_Vitality_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Restore_Vitality_Icon.webp/80px-Restore_Vitality_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Restore Vitality\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Restore_Vitality_Icon.webp/40px-Restore_Vitality_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9f/Restore_Vitality_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Restore_Vitality\" title=\"Restore Vitality\">Restore Vitality</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span id=\"Condition:_Warden_of_Vitality_.28Aura.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Warden_of_Vitality_(Aura)\"> Condition: Warden of Vitality (Aura) </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Warden_of_Vitality_(Aura)_(Condition)\" title=\"Warden of Vitality (Aura) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Warden_of_Vitality_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Warden_of_Vitality_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Warden_of_Vitality_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Warden_of_Vitality_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Warden_of_Vitality_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Warden_of_Vitality_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Warden of Vitality\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Warden_of_Vitality_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Warden_of_Vitality_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Warden_of_Vitality_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Warden_of_Vitality_(Aura)_(Condition)\" title=\"Warden of Vitality (Aura) (Condition)\">Warden of Vitality</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 10  turns</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity can use <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Restore_Vitality\" title=\"Restore Vitality\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Restore_Vitality_Icon.webp/25px-Restore_Vitality_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Restore_Vitality_Icon.webp/38px-Restore_Vitality_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Restore_Vitality_Icon.webp/50px-Restore_Vitality_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Restore Vitality\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Restore_Vitality_Icon.webp/25px-Restore_Vitality_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9f/Restore_Vitality_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Restore_Vitality\" title=\"Restore Vitality\">Restore Vitality</a> to heal itself or nearby allies.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\nClasses: <ul><li> Class level 6: <a href=\"/wiki/College_of_Lore\" title=\"College of Lore\">College of Lore</a> (via <a href=\"/wiki/Magical_Secrets\" title=\"Magical Secrets\">Magical Secrets</a>)</li><li> Class level 9: <a href=\"/wiki/Paladin\" title=\"Paladin\">Paladin</a></li><li> Class level 10: <a href=\"/wiki/Bard\" title=\"Bard\">Bard</a> (via <a href=\"/wiki/Magical_Secrets\" title=\"Magical Secrets\">Magical Secrets</a>)</li></ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This spell has been renamed from Aura of Vitality - its name in the tabletop version.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715035311\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.090 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.098 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3265/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 44019/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 17170/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 35/1000\nLua time usage: 0.024/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1370472/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n110.50%   89.397     38 Template:Trim\n100.00%   80.899      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%   80.899      1 -total\n 18.81%   15.220      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 16.04%   12.977      2 Template:SmSAI\n 15.61%   12.627      6 Template:Icon_text\n 14.56%   11.776      5 Template:Icon_link\n 13.83%   11.191      3 Template:Main_namespace_only\n 10.41%    8.422      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 10.31%    8.340      1 Template:Condition\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:10342-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715035311 and revision id 328309. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}